msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/feedPostingKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "feedPostingKind is functional"
msgstr "feedPostingKind 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/feedPostingKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:feedPostingKind is functional: a feed posting has exactly one kind drawn from the open gmeow:FeedPostingKind vocabulary, and that single flavour deterministically drives the schema projection — a social posting to schema:SocialMediaPosting, a blog posting to schema:BlogPosting — which two competing flavours on one posting would leave ambiguous."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:feedPostingKind 是函数性的：一条动态发布恰好具有一种取自开放词表 gmeow:FeedPostingKind 的类型，该唯一类型以确定的方式驱动模式投影——社交类发布投影到 schema:SocialMediaPosting，博客类发布投影到 schema:BlogPosting——若一条发布上存在两种相互竞争的类型，该投影就会变得含糊不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageOrientationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "imageOrientation is functional"
msgstr "imageOrientation 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageOrientationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:imageOrientation is functional: a media object has exactly one clockwise rotation from its normal orientation — a single EXIF angle (0, 90, 180, or 270 degrees) the solver applies when rendering — because one manifestation cannot be displayed rotated by two conflicting amounts at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:imageOrientation 是函数性的:一个媒体对象相对于其正常方向恰好有一个顺时针旋转量——渲染时求解器所应用的单一 EXIF 角度(0、90、180 或 270 度)——因为同一个体现物不能同时以两个相互冲突的角度旋转显示。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "mediaType is functional"
msgstr "mediaType 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:mediaType is functional: a concrete content carrier — an email body part, a Manifestation, a Distribution — has exactly one IANA media (MIME) type, since one artifact is encoded in a single format and distinct encodings are modelled as distinct carrier objects rather than two media types on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:mediaType 是函数式的:一个具体的内容载体——一个电子邮件正文部分、一个 Manifestation、一个 Distribution——恰好拥有一种 IANA 媒体(MIME)类型,因为一件工件以单一格式编码,不同的编码被建模为不同的载体对象,而不是在同一个对象上标注两种媒体类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pagePrincipalSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "pagePrincipalSubject is functional"
msgstr "pagePrincipalSubject 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pagePrincipalSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pagePrincipalSubject is functional: a web page is primarily about exactly one entity — the single principal subject it represents — even though it may mention many others through the broader gmeow:isAbout it specialises."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pagePrincipalSubject 是函数性的:一个网页恰好主要关于一个实体——它所代表的唯一主要主题——即便它通过其所特化的更广泛的 gmeow:isAbout 可能提及许多其他实体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pixelHeightFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "pixelHeight is functional"
msgstr "pixelHeight 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pixelHeightFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pixelHeight is functional: a media object has exactly one height in pixels, since a single raster manifestation has one vertical dimension and distinct renditions are distinct gmeow:MediaObject carriers rather than two heights on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pixelHeight 是函数性的:一个媒体对象恰好有一个像素高度,因为单一栅格呈现只有一个纵向尺寸,不同的呈现形式是不同的 gmeow:MediaObject 载体,而非在同一载体上有两个高度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pixelWidthFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "pixelWidth is functional"
msgstr "pixelWidth 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pixelWidthFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pixelWidth is functional: a media object has exactly one width in pixels, since a single raster manifestation has one horizontal dimension and distinct renditions are distinct gmeow:MediaObject carriers rather than two widths on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pixelWidth 是函数性的:一个媒体对象恰好有一个像素宽度,因为单一栅格呈现只有一个横向尺寸,不同的呈现形式是不同的 gmeow:MediaObject 载体,而非在同一载体上有两个宽度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentIndexFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "segmentIndex is functional"
msgstr "segmentIndex 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentIndexFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:segmentIndex is functional: a content segment occupies exactly one structural position within its containing whole — a single 1-based index locating it in that one container's ordering — while perspectival reorderings ride a separate gmeow:ReadingOrder standpoint rather than a second index."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:segmentIndex 是函数性的:一个内容片段在其所属整体中恰好占据一个结构位置——一个基于 1 的单一索引,用于在该容器的排序中定位它——而视角性的重新排序则依赖于独立的 gmeow:ReadingOrder 视点,而不是第二个索引。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "segmentType is functional"
msgstr "segmentType 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:segmentType is functional: a content segment is of exactly one structural kind — a single gmeow:ContentSegmentType value such as chapter, section, or scene — because the kind axis is carried as a property value rather than a subclass (Principle 9) and one segment cannot simultaneously be two structural kinds."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:segmentType 是函数性的:一个内容段落恰好属于一种结构类型——单一的 gmeow:ContentSegmentType 值,例如 chapter、section 或 scene——因为该类型轴是作为属性值而非子类来承载的(原则 9),一个段落不能同时属于两种结构类型。"
